3Com EtherLink III CLI Configuration Program v0.7.5
by The Phintage Collector (Gianpaolo Del Matto)
https://github.com/gpdm/TPC-3CCFGCLI
reimplementation of the original 3Com EtherLink III Configuration Utility v3.2

Usage: 3CCFGCLI [COMMAND]

Commands:
  /? or /H
    Display this help screen.

  LIST
    Detect and display 3C509 and 3C509B adapters.

  SAVECONFIG [/OUTPUTFILE:file] [/EXECFILE:program]
    Export all adapter configurations to a restore batch file.
    /OUTPUTFILE overrides the output batch file (default: RESTORE.BAT).
    /EXECFILE overrides the embedded program name (default: self).

  CONFIGURE [options]
    Configure ISA adapter properties. Options:

    /ADAPTERNUM:N                  Select adapter N (from LIST).
    /INT:N                         Set IRQ (3,5,7,9,10,11,12,15).
    /IOBASE:NNN                    Set ISA IOBASE address (hex).
    /PNP:ENABLED|DISABLED          Plug and Play mode.
    /FULLDUPLEX:ENABLED|DISABLED   Full duplex mode.
    /TR:TP|AUI|COAX|AUTO           Transceiver type.
    /XCVR:...                      Alias for /TR.
    /MODEM:N|NONE                  Modem speed/interrupt-disable tuning.
    /OPTIMIZE:DOS|WINDOWS|OS/2|SERVER
                                   Network workload optimization.
    /BADDRESS:NNNNN                Boot ROM base (hex, C0000-DE000,
                                   2000h steps); requires /BSIZE.
    /BSIZE:8|16|32|DISABLED       Boot ROM size in KB, or DISABLED;
                                   a size requires /BADDRESS.

Global options (valid with any command):
  /VERBOSE                       Show verbose transaction details.
